{"path":"memory/owner_hash","title":"std::owner_hash","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>owner_hash","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/owner_hash","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"This function object provides owner-based (as opposed to value-based) hashing of both std::weak_ptr and std::shared_ptr.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/memory\">&lt;memory&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> owner_hash<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>This function object provides owner-based (as opposed to value-based) hashing of both <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/weak_ptr\">std::weak_ptr</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\">std::shared_ptr</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Nested_types\">Nested types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Nested type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>is_transparent</code>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional#Transparent_function_objects\">unspecified</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><strong class=\"selflink\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></strong></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  calculates the hash of the shared-ownership pointer <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::owner_hash::operator.28.29\"><span clas