\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> key.<span class=\"me1\">owner_hash</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> key\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> shared-ownership pointer to be hashed\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A hash value that is identical for any <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\">std::shared_ptr</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/weak_ptr\">std::weak_ptr</a></span> object sharing the same ownership.\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_smart_ptr_owner_equality\"><code>__cpp_lib_smart_ptr_owner_equality</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/26#cpp_lib_smart_ptr_owner_equality_202306L\"><code>202306L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++26)</span></td>\n<td>Enabling the use of <code>std::shared_ptr</code> and <code>std::weak_ptr</code> as keys in <a href=\"/w/cpp/container#Unordered_associative_containers\">unordered associative containers</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr/owner_hash\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>owner_hash</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides owner-based hashing of shared pointers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function o